### Execute mock AI request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}-ai

{
  "provider": "mock",
  "model": "mock-1",
  "operation": "CHAT",
  "input": {
    "prompt": "Give a short local test response."
  }
}

### AI history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/requests?limit=25&provider=mock
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### AI request detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/requests/{{aiRequestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cancel a queued request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/requests/{{aiRequestId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Common error: mock provider failure
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}-ai-failure

{
  "provider": "mock",
  "model": "mock-1",
  "operation": "CHAT",
  "input": { "simulateFailure": true }
}

